stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Working
    Working --> Paused: time is up, work is kept
    Paused --> Working: you grant more time
    Paused --> WrappedUp: no more time given
    Paused --> Stopped: you cancel it
    Working --> Done: finished in time
    Done --> [*]
    WrappedUp --> [*]
    Stopped --> [*]
